      "settings": {
        "replo_text_6f9636cb-16a7-4997-8b00-0a927592031f": "<p>A Story in Ever Ring</p>",
        "replo_text_04ce3989-961a-4ae3-a2c0-f60662f5d583": "<p>1</p>",
        "replo_text_decef662-f285-4e07-a754-7c3e19bd33d8": "<p>Patrick Adair Designs rings are handcrafted to last a life time, featuring our \"perfect fit\" guarantee and an array of extraordinary materials. From aerospace grade titanium to virtually indestructible tungsten, each ring is a masterpiece of style and comfort.</p>",
        "replo_text_963c8493-7aca-432d-aeb6-df817d4653a0": "<p>Unique Designs. Perfect Fit. </p>",
        "replo_text_a9af9636-76f0-435b-8870-4b447b1e9781": "<p>2</p>",
        "replo_text_cfd1a468-74ce-41e0-8263-8cf38343ba49": "<p>Patrick Adair Designs rings are handcrafted to last a life time, featuring our \"perfect fit\" guarantee and an array of extraordinary materials. From aerospace grade titanium to virtually indestructible tungsten, each ring is a masterpiece of style and comfort.</p>",
        "replo_text_ef5a86ab-9656-4fa7-970e-73bf0b496709": "<p>Always Have a Backup Ring.</p>",
        "replo_text_f197e70f-a372-4f57-a09e-a150f4cbe61d": "<p>3</p>",
        "replo_text_4b4cdbb7-1c71-43dd-88da-1d6a27674c03": "<p>Handcrafted.</p>",
        "replo_text_283e86b8-c85d-47b1-9f45-8bd893a6c310": "<p>4</p>",
        "replo_text_f626cdd1-28f9-4fab-b451-f07b06c13dc6": "<p>Most jewelry is mass produced by machines overseas. Not ours. Every Patrick Adair ring is handcrafted start to finish by trained artisans. This ensures your ring is a one-of-a-kind luxury piece. </p>",
        "replo_text_2f234786-b7bd-4152-bd8c-f46235fb6ffc": "<p>Dozens of Materials. Hundreds of Designs. </p>",
        "replo_text_57c473e3-f461-4019-b8e2-65616402fcdd": "<p>5</p>",
        "replo_text_2c368940-a99d-4792-bcf1-82a264892cd1": "<p>100% Satisfaction Guaranteed. </p>",
        "replo_text_9fc9939a-81e4-4eff-b4c1-5ed202f737b8": "<p>6</p>",
        "replo_text_cae97183-691e-432a-af7e-6908870885c1": "<p>We promise you'll love your ring. If not, we guarantee we'll help you find a solution. We aren't happy until your happy. </p>"
